     },
     "body": "<p>Pending response to code review.</p>\n\n<p>Also, although the scenario in this ticket now result in the correct `&lt;/foo/fcr:acl#authz&gt;` subject, there appears to be another block of triples included in the /fcr:acl response:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/fcrepo/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/foo/fcr:acl&gt;\r\n</span>        rdf:type               fedora:Resource ;\r\n        rdf:type               webac:Acl ;\r\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"fedoraAdmin\"</span> ;\r\n        fedora:createdBy       <span class=\"code-quote\">\"fedoraAdmin\"</span> ;\r\n        fedora:created         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2018-07-13T16:06:59.823Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\r\n</span>        fedora:lastModified    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2018-07-13T16:07:19.059Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; .\r\n</span>\r\n&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/fcrepo/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/foo/fcr:acl#authz&gt;\r\n</span>        rdf:type      acl:Authorization ;\r\n        acl:accessTo  &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/fcrepo/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/<span class=\"code-keyword\">new</span>&gt; ;\r\n</span>        acl:mode      acl:READ ;\r\n        acl:agent     <span class=\"code-quote\">\"testuser\"</span> .\r\n\r\n&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/fcrepo/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/foo/fcr:acl&gt;\r\n</span>        rdf:type         ldp:RDFSource ;\r\n        rdf:type         ldp:Container ;\r\n        rdf:type         ldp:BasicContainer ;\r\n        fedora:writable  <span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span> .\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
     "created": "13/Jul/18 1:10 PM",
